---
title: "toggleAdminStatus (stem-system: Admin Status Toggle)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: supabase.auth.getUser()
    q_auth --> q_no_auth: no user
    q_auth --> q_check_admin: user present
    q_no_auth --> [*]: return error (auth required)
    q_check_admin --> q_query_admin: select is_admin from members where user_id
    q_query_admin --> q_not_admin: not admin
    q_query_admin --> q_check_self: is admin
    q_not_admin --> [*]: return error (admin required)
    q_check_self --> q_is_self: user.id == userId
    q_check_self --> q_toggle: user.id != userId
    q_is_self --> [*]: return error (cannot change own admin status)
    q_toggle --> q_update: members.update(is_admin = !currentStatus) where userId
    q_update --> q_error: update error
    q_update --> q_revalidate: success
    q_error --> [*]: return error (update failed)
    q_revalidate --> [*]: revalidatePath, return success

    note right of q_check_self
        INV-001: admin cannot toggle their own admin status (self-lockout prevention)
    end note

    note right of q_check_admin
        INV-002: admin check uses cookie-based client (RLS applies)
    end note
